5,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to be with you all. Let us approach this selection with wisdom and a spirit of generosity toward the future of our science. I look forward to our deliberation.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Thank you, Servas. I am very happy to be here with you all. I hope we can work together harmoniously to find the best possible project for this grant.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I'm really excited to be part of this. Let's make sure we pick a project that's not just great on paper, but actually has the support it needs to succeed!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji. A brilliant proposal is merely a blueprint; the actual construction requires a stable foundation. I believe a pragmatic look at the operational side of things would be most illuminating.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Benjamin. A proposal's ambition is secondary to its feasibility. I believe we should look closely at the historical data to see what actually translates into results.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,Wisdom teaches us that the heart of any great endeavor is the people who carry it. I believe we must ensure the human element is secure before we commit our resources.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. The people involved are so important. I also wonder if we should look at how the funding is actually distributed to ensure the researchers have what they truly need.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"That's a great point, Midori! I'm worried about the shared tools and services everyone uses. If the facilities are overloaded, even the best team will struggle. We should check how those are doing!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A valid concern, Kenji. It would be a tragedy to fund a project only for it to languish in a queue. I suspect the friction points are often hidden in the administrative margins.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"Administrative margins are often where the truth lies. I am interested in the patterns of success and failure over time, rather than just the current promises.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is a joy to see such thoughtful perspectives. Let us now decide which records will guide us. I shall look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and minutes on secondments and crew strength.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I think it would be helpful to see the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers, as well as the national computing agreement and facility day rates. I want to understand the current costs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll go with accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation! I want to see if the equipment is actually available and working for everyone.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the portfolio review of schedule overruns and the closeout files of finished awards. It would be most prudent to discover where previous projects encountered their most stubborn obstacles.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns. I want to see which types of projects actually delivered on their promises.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a balanced approach. By examining both the human spirit and the structural records, we shall find a path that ensures the grant flourishes. I wish you all clarity in your findings.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. I hope the information we find helps us make a fair and supportive decision for the researchers. I look forward to hearing what everyone discovers in the next round.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm ready! I can't wait to see what we find out. Let's all do our best to help the researchers get the support they deserve! See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A most optimistic sentiment, Kenji. I shall await the revelations of the archives with a measured curiosity. Until we reconvene, I wish you all a productive investigation.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I concur. Let us see if the records reflect the reality of the outcomes. I look forward to the results.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
